    "### Inciso (b) — Rango de masa en kg\n",
    "\n",
    "La masa equivalente de $100$ GeV es $1.7 \\times 10^{-25}$ kg.  \n",
    "Por lo tanto, el factor de conversión es:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$1 \\text{ GeV} \\equiv \\frac{1.7 \\times 10^{-25}}{100} = 1.7 \\times 10^{-27} \\text{ kg/GeV}$$\n",
    "\n",
    "Aplicando esta conversión al intervalo encontrado $115 < m < 160$ GeV:\n",
    "\n",
    "$$m_{\\min} = 115 \\times 1.7 \\times 10^{-27} = 1.955 \\times 10^{-25} \\text{ kg}$$\n",
    "$$m_{\\max} = 160 \\times 1.7 \\times 10^{-27} = 2.72 \\times 10^{-25} \\text{ kg}$$"
   ]
